Dataset_Source:
Top 9 Moscow Exchange stocks;
5-minute historical stock data obtained via FINAM /
Moscow Exchange-related public data

Raw_Input_Features:
Lagged daily, weekly and monthly realized volatility; RGBI;
RTSI log-returns; GDP; CPI; dwellings commenced; dividend-price
ratio; earnings-price ratio; imports/exports; High-Low liquidity;
calendar and overnight effects; S&P 500 realized volatility;
Brent oil-price returns.
